      "text": "Tamamlananlar\u0131n cheklenmesi gerekiyor",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tamamlananlar\u0131n cheklenmesi gerekiyor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kdiuNQ8M5_NJTRlZX7ACs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 66.75,
      "width": 767.7394409179688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 303301497,
      "version": 140,
      "versionNonce": 886754873,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Onboarding ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 \u2014 Kay\u0131t olduktan sonra kullan\u0131c\u0131 ne yapmal\u0131? \u0130sim, i\u015Fletme t\u00FCr\u00FC,\n\u00E7al\u0131\u015Fma saatleri gibi temel bilgileri toplayan bir sihirbaz (wizard) gerekir",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Onboarding ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 \u2014 Kay\u0131t olduktan sonra kullan\u0131c\u0131 ne yapmal\u0131? \u0130sim, i\u015Fletme t\u00FCr\u00FC, \u00E7al\u0131\u015Fma saatleri gibi temel bilgileri toplayan bir sihirbaz (wizard) gerekir",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SGNNzBXCmSbj5AOgoUBih",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 140.5,
      "width": 760.95947265625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 221902743,
      "version": 188,
      "versionNonce": 414621465,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zaman dilimi (timezone) y\u00F6netimi \u2014 Kullan\u0131c\u0131 T\u00FCrkiye\u0027de, randevu alan ki\u015Fi ba\u015Fka\n\u00FClkede olabilir. Bu genelde en \u00E7ok hata yap\u0131lan k\u0131s\u0131md\u0131r",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zaman dilimi (timezone) y\u00F6netimi \u2014 Kullan\u0131c\u0131 T\u00FCrkiye\u0027de, randevu alan ki\u015Fi ba\u015Fka \u00FClkede olabilir. Bu genelde en \u00E7ok hata yap\u0131lan k\u0131s\u0131md\u0131r",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tbJIgtP-u2sp49lHKbLVv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 216.75,
      "width": 778.37939453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 454630873,
      "version": 194,
      "versionNonce": 916804601,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Buffer time \u2014 Randevular aras\u0131 bo\u015Fluk b\u0131rakma (\u00F6rn. her randevudan sonra 15 dk\nmola)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Buffer time \u2014 Randevular aras\u0131 bo\u015Fluk b\u0131rakma (\u00F6rn. her randevudan sonra 15 dk mola)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gwbrI8ZAbzGwvgtzKQ3hV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 290.5,
      "width": 782.9594116210938,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 353106295,
      "version": 186,
      "versionNonce": 313158873,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Minimum/maksimum ileri tarih \u2014 \u0022En erken 2 saat sonras\u0131na randevu al\u0131nabilir\u0022, \u0022en\nfazla 60 g\u00FCn ileriye randevu a\u00E7\u0131k\u0022 gibi kurallar",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Minimum/maksimum ileri tarih \u2014 \u0022En erken 2 saat sonras\u0131na randevu al\u0131nabilir\u0022, \u0022en fazla 60 g\u00FCn ileriye randevu a\u00E7\u0131k\u0022 gibi kurallar",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Hk8BRbZm8SvuX1AKFj9X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 376.75,
      "width": 732.239501953125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1042480183,
      "version": 177,
      "versionNonce": 1683581369,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Onay mekanizmas\u0131 \u2014 Randevu otomatik onaylan\u0131yor mu, yoksa i\u015Fletme sahibi\nonaylamal\u0131 m\u0131?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Onay mekanizmas\u0131 \u2014 Randevu otomatik onaylan\u0131yor mu, yoksa i\u015Fletme sahibi onaylamal\u0131 m\u0131?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Gx656aaVGqj5TmmyKAFGV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 469.25,
      "width": 786.83935546875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 886838297,
      "version": 164,
      "versionNonce": 617990809,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u0130ptal/yeniden planlama \u2014 M\u00FC\u015Fteri kendi randevusunu iptal edebilmeli mi, hangi s\u00FCre\n\u00F6ncesine kadar (\u00F6rn. \u002224 saat \u00F6ncesine kadar iptal edilebilir\u0022)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u0130ptal/yeniden planlama \u2014 M\u00FC\u015Fteri kendi randevusunu iptal edebilmeli mi, hangi s\u00FCre \u00F6ncesine kadar (\u00F6rn. \u002224 saat \u00F6ncesine kadar iptal edilebilir\u0022)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C6iQkWY-S8_csc-2P_5o2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 563,
      "width": 407.7996826171875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1258200791,
      "version": 175,
      "versionNonce": 1557335929,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "9. \u00D6zelle\u015Ftirme (Beyaz Etiket / Branding)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "9. \u00D6zelle\u015Ftirme (Beyaz Etiket / Branding)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L5W_EduFOxelsIXgr2pZ5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 605.5,
      "width": 796.9393310546875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1625333273,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 848607321,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Her i\u015Fletme kendi logosunu, renk temas\u0131n\u0131 (az \u00F6nce konu\u015Ftu\u011Fumuz tema sistemi tam\nburada i\u015Fe yar\u0131yor), randevu sayfas\u0131 metnini \u00F6zelle\u015Ftirebilmeli",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Her i\u015Fletme kendi logosunu, renk temas\u0131n\u0131 (az \u00F6nce konu\u015Ftu\u011Fumuz tema sistemi tam burada i\u015Fe yar\u0131yor), randevu sayfas\u0131 metnini \u00F6zelle\u015Ftirebilmeli",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3gRXR1gvmaIMLn3ilm8rY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
