      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786085963352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Yo\u011Fun saatlerde (\u00F6rn. herkesin ayn\u0131 anda randevu kontrol etti\u011Fi durumlarda)\nveritaban\u0131 y\u00FCk\u00FC",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yo\u011Fun saatlerde (\u00F6rn. herkesin ayn\u0131 anda randevu kontrol etti\u011Fi durumlarda) veritaban\u0131 y\u00FCk\u00FC",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6iLd-8CvgDO1h9mSLvdbZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1265.6302795410156,
      "y": 914.25,
